WEBVTT

00:00:10.571 --> 00:00:15.721
Don’t blame yourself. That’s your problem.

00:00:15.731 --> 00:00:19.241
Yesterday I told you to say that I’m not guilty.

00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:23.133
It’s just a joke you are enjoying,

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:26.293
you are just playing
guilts with yourself

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:29.190
when you say that.

00:00:29.206 --> 00:00:34.747
Because you like to play such
terrible jokes with yourself.

00:00:34.754 --> 00:00:38.678
Don’t say that you are guilty at all.

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:41.204
By saying that, you see, you are trying to

00:00:41.204 --> 00:00:43.413
enjoy a sort of a sadism
against yourself.

00:00:43.413 --> 00:00:47.123
You are against your Self.

00:00:47.153 --> 00:00:50.263
Self, that is your Spirit.

00:00:53.983 --> 00:00:57.748
That's what it feels like.It feel like um..

00:00:57.774 --> 00:01:00.151
It’s not a good thing.

00:01:00.184 --> 00:01:03.334
It is not what is wanted.
It's not that is desired for you.

00:01:03.334 --> 00:01:07.871
So, just don’t play on it.

00:01:07.889 --> 00:01:13.434
Whatever are your moods are not
correct, it should not be there.

00:01:17.569 --> 00:01:21.685
By your moods, you are lost!

00:01:21.699 --> 00:01:23.769
Sometimes you get this mood,

00:01:23.785 --> 00:01:28.275
sometimes you get another
mood of aggression.

00:01:28.285 --> 00:01:31.281
You are in a temper or
something like that.

00:01:31.315 --> 00:01:34.305
And sometimes you get into this
kind of absolute elated mood.

00:01:34.335 --> 00:01:37.869
Both are useless, absolutely.
Just throw them away.

00:01:39.275 --> 00:01:41.929
Why  should we do that?

00:01:56.399 --> 00:01:58.899
Both are mythical.

00:02:01.477 --> 00:02:05.161
[unclear]

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:10.461
Yes, the positivity, also the so-called
positivity, means aggression on others.

00:02:10.481 --> 00:02:13.491
You start showing your
aggression on others.

00:02:13.491 --> 00:02:16.488
You can aggress others, also.

00:02:16.496 --> 00:02:20.605
That's even worse.

00:02:20.633 --> 00:02:23.100
[unclear] love and happiness…

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:25.878
That’s, that’s the thing I was saying.

00:02:25.878 --> 00:02:32.003
Be joyous, be happy for
what God has given you.

00:02:32.028 --> 00:02:37.547
Watch the birds in the morning time.

00:02:37.568 --> 00:02:42.408
See the flowers in the morning time,

00:02:44.188 --> 00:02:47.789
what do they have?

00:02:47.808 --> 00:02:52.649
They are standing in the sun, in the rain,

00:02:52.667 --> 00:02:55.778
they are facing the nature all the time.

00:02:55.787 --> 00:03:04.398
Imagine the delicate
petals of the flowers,

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:12.583
do they show any signs of
negativity or of aggression?

00:03:12.593 --> 00:03:16.313
They only emit fragrance.

00:03:16.328 --> 00:03:18.783
Till they live, they will emit fragrance,

00:03:18.783 --> 00:03:22.929
if they will die, they're not bothered.

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:29.473
Aggressive person, cannot
come to Sahaja Yoga!

00:03:29.473 --> 00:03:31.542
They cannot  go very far.

00:03:31.562 --> 00:03:37.512
Neither a negative person! But
aggressive cannot. He'll drop out.

00:03:41.853 --> 00:03:45.974
Sahaja Yoga recedes from such people.

00:03:50.414 --> 00:03:52.864
You have to be humble,

00:03:54.654 --> 00:03:58.474
but you are not to be slaves!

00:04:00.534 --> 00:04:05.114
In extremes, at least one should
know the difference between the two.

00:04:07.196 --> 00:04:10.775
If there are extremes –
say something is very black,

00:04:10.791 --> 00:04:15.455
then you can see the white
very clearly against it.

00:04:15.461 --> 00:04:18.371
When you know how to move from
one extreme to another extremes,

00:04:18.371 --> 00:04:23.961
you should be able to see

00:04:23.971 --> 00:04:27.816
both the things very clearly.

00:04:27.866 --> 00:04:31.946
And that’s how you come to the centre.

00:04:36.706 --> 00:04:41.966
Maybe it is for your
own good to be like that.

00:04:41.986 --> 00:04:47.386
You may say – ‘Yes, we understand
Mother, but we can’t do it.

00:04:47.403 --> 00:04:49.903
You can!

00:04:49.903 --> 00:04:52.935
You just watch yourself

00:04:52.973 --> 00:04:57.462
and see how it works,
how your mind is working.

00:04:57.471 --> 00:05:02.386
It’s your horse, you have to master it!

00:05:02.391 --> 00:05:06.801
You are supposed to be a rider,
and the horse is taking you

00:05:06.811 --> 00:05:09.796
somewhere, wherever it feels like;

00:05:09.801 --> 00:05:12.661
either to negativity, or go to the positivity,

00:05:12.661 --> 00:05:16.894
so called, doing the aggressiveness.

00:05:20.051 --> 00:05:25.151
It is the horse that is leading
you, not you are leading the horse.

00:05:25.173 --> 00:05:28.711
What kind of a rider it is?

00:05:30.521 --> 00:05:37.007
And the horse is like a pendulum,

00:05:37.027 --> 00:05:39.527
and you are led by it.

00:05:42.117 --> 00:05:47.517
Then, when you identify
yourself with that horse,

00:05:47.514 --> 00:05:50.014
you think what you do it is happening.

00:05:50.014 --> 00:05:53.796
You can control it.

00:06:01.874 --> 00:06:05.445
You have to tell yourself

00:06:05.464 --> 00:06:10.619
that is to tell your mind to behave itself,

00:06:10.643 --> 00:06:14.423
otherwise you people cannot
go very deep into Sahaja Yoga.

00:06:17.643 --> 00:06:20.143
You have to go much deeper.

00:06:20.143 --> 00:06:24.356
If you are worried about
superficialities, you cannot go deeper.

00:06:30.657 --> 00:06:36.585
Deep down is the truth, there lies all the joy.

00:06:39.867 --> 00:06:45.167
All the trees, all living things,
have their roots deep down.

00:06:48.225 --> 00:06:52.792
Find out your roots, where are they?

00:06:52.815 --> 00:06:58.792
They are all imbedded in
your heart, in your Spirit.

00:07:05.147 --> 00:07:10.243
Nothing [unclear,] your superficial thing, where
your mind is moving like a wind here and there

00:07:10.243 --> 00:07:13.797
just like a dead leaf.

00:07:19.977 --> 00:07:26.377
If a big train is coming,

00:07:26.387 --> 00:07:30.027
and the train is faced,  say with the,

00:07:30.057 --> 00:07:34.297
some sort of an
obstacle, it cannot stop.

00:07:34.307 --> 00:07:37.537
But if there is a little worm

00:07:37.557 --> 00:07:41.917
and if it wants to save
itself from the train, it can.

00:07:41.936 --> 00:07:47.384
It can hide itself or something.

00:07:47.396 --> 00:07:51.455
You are not a worm,
you are a human being.

00:07:51.475 --> 00:07:56.895
A little living thing can do that much.

00:07:56.914 --> 00:07:59.624
You are a human being,

00:07:59.645 --> 00:08:08.475
and if you cannot stop
yourself from your destruction,

00:08:08.485 --> 00:08:11.950
then who can stop you?

00:08:14.235 --> 00:08:17.105
You see the nature,

00:08:17.145 --> 00:08:21.425
people live together.
Tiger lives in a forest

00:08:21.425 --> 00:08:23.925
and there are many
creatures who exist.

00:08:29.735 --> 00:08:33.460
But if human beings
cannot save themselves,

00:08:33.485 --> 00:08:37.885
with all the brain that they have [unclear]

00:08:37.895 --> 00:08:40.155
with all the energy that they have,

00:08:40.155 --> 00:08:44.775
with all the discoveries
that they have made,

00:08:44.794 --> 00:08:48.108
then who is going to save oneself?

00:08:51.879 --> 00:08:56.579
Either you aggress on
others, or you kill yourself.

00:08:56.585 --> 00:08:58.659
And then what should Mataji do?

00:08:58.659 --> 00:09:03.989
What should anyone do
under these circumstances?

00:09:04.009 --> 00:09:06.961
But to make you face it.

00:09:14.719 --> 00:09:20.040
In Sahaja Yoga, you can
face it very clearly.

00:09:20.061 --> 00:09:22.407
You can see others doing it also.

00:09:22.407 --> 00:09:24.711
But first you must see it in yourself.

00:09:24.711 --> 00:09:27.851
Unless and until you see it in yourself,
what you are doing to yourself,

00:09:27.861 --> 00:09:30.361
you cannot see in others.

00:09:36.101 --> 00:09:38.971
When I say, "You see it in
yourself," you became self-centred.

00:09:38.971 --> 00:09:43.321
I mean, anything you
say, can be twisted.

00:09:43.321 --> 00:09:45.051
When I say, "You
see it in yourself,"

00:09:45.076 --> 00:09:48.101
that means, you detach
yourself and see in yourself.

00:09:48.126 --> 00:09:49.526
What is your mind doing?

00:09:49.542 --> 00:09:51.716
That’s how you can learn others.

00:09:51.716 --> 00:09:56.626
Also, that they are doing the same.

00:09:56.656 --> 00:10:00.056
Like, a person – say,
is fond of good food

00:10:00.076 --> 00:10:03.226
Alright!

00:10:03.266 --> 00:10:05.686
If he can see that he is
hankering after good food,

00:10:05.686 --> 00:10:07.076
all the time he is
thinking about food,

00:10:07.076 --> 00:10:09.256
his mind is working like that,

00:10:09.256 --> 00:10:13.136
if he can see that, he can
correct it also, if he can see it.

00:10:13.178 --> 00:10:18.463
Apart from that, when he
sees somebody doing it,

00:10:18.496 --> 00:10:21.965
he would not hate that person,

00:10:21.986 --> 00:10:26.613
but he would help him to cure.

00:10:26.656 --> 00:10:29.845
On the contrary, I have seen
those who are like that

00:10:29.866 --> 00:10:31.625
hate the other person,

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:35.974
make fun of the other person
while they have the same weakness.

00:10:39.058 --> 00:10:45.010
Why, why it happens? There
is a psychology behind it.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:50.533
Because that one which is
doing like this wrong in him,

00:10:50.538 --> 00:10:53.768
you hate that one in you,

00:10:53.788 --> 00:10:55.588
subconsciously,

00:10:55.588 --> 00:10:58.088
and that’s what you hate in others.

00:10:58.088 --> 00:11:00.138
But that is consciously.

00:11:00.138 --> 00:11:03.979
If you hate that part in you consciously,

00:11:04.008 --> 00:11:06.508
there wouldn’t be any problem!

00:11:09.238 --> 00:11:11.048
That part which is negative,

00:11:11.048 --> 00:11:12.988
the part that is telling
you all these things,

00:11:12.988 --> 00:11:14.958
the part that misleads you,

00:11:14.958 --> 00:11:17.348
the part that spoils you,

00:11:17.348 --> 00:11:19.678
the part that covers the Self you see,

00:11:19.678 --> 00:11:22.178
in you,

00:11:25.318 --> 00:11:29.298
if you could manage to see that,
and say "No, not that part."

00:11:29.303 --> 00:11:30.398
No.

00:11:30.418 --> 00:11:34.923
But, then you start despising the whole.

00:11:34.948 --> 00:11:37.448
It’s a very subtle thing.

00:11:37.448 --> 00:11:39.528
Either you move from
this side to that side,

00:11:39.528 --> 00:11:42.938
if I try to push you, you just go
like a sprint to the other end.

00:11:42.938 --> 00:11:46.418
When I have to push on that side, like
a sprint you go to the other end.

00:11:46.441 --> 00:11:53.557
The thing is, the basic thing is that
the extremes are to be avoided.

00:11:53.577 --> 00:11:57.323
This is the basic point,
is extremes to be avoided.

00:12:00.867 --> 00:12:05.587
If you feel you are getting negative,
take a shoe, beat yourself nicely.

00:12:05.616 --> 00:12:10.136
Go out and shout,

00:12:10.156 --> 00:12:12.656
or take a pillow

00:12:12.656 --> 00:12:15.156
and hit it hard. Alright?

00:12:17.956 --> 00:12:19.347
But if you are negative inside,

00:12:19.347 --> 00:12:22.827
what you will do, you will
go and beat your wife

00:12:22.847 --> 00:12:27.217
or beat your husband;
whatever may be the case.

00:12:33.904 --> 00:12:37.459
It’s a very simple thing
for a Sahaja Yogi to do,

00:12:37.459 --> 00:12:41.267
is to be amused about yourself.

00:12:41.297 --> 00:12:44.327
Just be amused, "Look at
this Mr. So-and-so."

00:12:44.327 --> 00:12:46.707
Now see.

00:12:46.707 --> 00:12:51.617
When you start seeing yourself like
that, you see, you’ll be amused at yourself.

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:57.027
"Now, so now, Mr. So-and-so
is coming up like this."

00:12:57.052 --> 00:12:59.460
"Oh, come along, come
along. Now the vanity,

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:04.577
come along, I would like to
see the vanity that I am."

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:10.426
Seeing Mr. Ego coming up,
now, "Here Mr. Ego stand."

00:13:10.451 --> 00:13:12.206
Then you'll start seeing.

00:13:12.206 --> 00:13:14.706
Be amused about it in the real sense.

00:13:14.706 --> 00:13:18.894
And you will be surprised that
these things will drop out.

00:13:24.884 --> 00:13:30.110
[unclear]

00:13:30.125 --> 00:13:32.625
Yes, yes, of course. Very much. Yes.

00:13:32.625 --> 00:13:35.801
Yes.

00:13:35.825 --> 00:13:41.895
No you should say, "Get a way.
You take two running jumps and go."

00:13:50.646 --> 00:13:53.747
That will help.

00:13:53.766 --> 00:13:57.937
If you want to have
phraseologies, I can tell you.

00:13:57.947 --> 00:14:00.447
But I think you are
much more equipped

00:14:00.447 --> 00:14:05.020
in English language with all
the beautiful humour that have,

00:14:05.041 --> 00:14:07.740
you have.

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:09.740
Just play that on
yourself, you see.

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:14.781
Humour is a beautiful thing that
you can really play on to yourself.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:18.808
Instead of playing these
melancholy sounds and

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:25.811
foolishly indulging into
all of this romantic nonsense.

00:14:25.828 --> 00:14:28.365
Better play some humour on yourself,

00:14:28.378 --> 00:14:34.085
sit down, repeat some humour
and enjoy the humour upon yourself!

00:14:39.045 --> 00:14:45.995
It works wondrously.

00:14:46.002 --> 00:14:50.760
And those who know how to laugh at
themselves are the best people.

00:14:57.356 --> 00:15:00.976
This is what it is, and then
when you are meditating,

00:15:01.009 --> 00:15:05.499
then you will find real diamonds sparkling.

00:15:08.309 --> 00:15:10.809
All that was foolish is chiselled down,

00:15:10.809 --> 00:15:16.219
and you see that beautiful
joy-giving Spirit

00:15:16.244 --> 00:15:20.818
manifesting itself beautifully
when you are alone,

00:15:20.829 --> 00:15:23.039
and all your worry, all your problems,

00:15:23.039 --> 00:15:26.379
and all negativity and so-called
aggressiveness and everything

00:15:26.379 --> 00:15:29.505
just disappears, and
you are one with that,

00:15:29.519 --> 00:15:32.673
and you are seeing proof of that,

00:15:32.679 --> 00:15:34.665
the brilliance that it is joy,

00:15:34.665 --> 00:15:37.165
you are seeing and feeling
this dignity of that

00:15:37.165 --> 00:15:39.665
and the joy of it; the
brilliance that is flowing,

00:15:39.665 --> 00:15:42.165
just think if you are
the sun, and you come,

00:15:42.165 --> 00:15:44.665
and you see the sun, I
mean the rays coming

00:15:44.665 --> 00:15:47.065
and working it out and curing

00:15:47.065 --> 00:15:50.395
and changing the colours,
and giving life.

00:15:50.432 --> 00:15:53.522
Imagine!

00:15:53.532 --> 00:15:56.822
How dignified you feel and
how beautiful you feel!

00:15:56.842 --> 00:15:59.992
But you don’t feel vain about it.

00:16:00.002 --> 00:16:02.502
If you are that, you just don’t
feel that there is something

00:16:02.502 --> 00:16:07.766
special about it, you just see it.

00:16:07.795 --> 00:16:10.516
Vanity comes when you
don’t have something.

00:16:10.565 --> 00:16:13.065
When you have it, you say
‘it’s alright, it’s me,

00:16:13.065 --> 00:16:14.255
it’s just flowing,

00:16:14.256 --> 00:16:18.045
just watching  how
beautifully it is flowing."

00:16:21.185 --> 00:16:26.977
Because of scientific research
in the psychological sphere,

00:16:27.009 --> 00:16:30.747
this myth has come to us that if
we try to enjoy something like that,

00:16:30.747 --> 00:16:33.147
then you become proud.

00:16:33.147 --> 00:16:35.007
So, you just don’t enjoy. I mean

00:16:35.007 --> 00:16:37.507
the sum total of the whole
thing in psychoanalysis

00:16:37.507 --> 00:16:40.977
that you don’t enjoy anything in life.

00:16:40.977 --> 00:16:43.117
In the sum total,

00:16:43.117 --> 00:16:45.177
it counts too.

00:16:45.198 --> 00:16:49.450
If it is not worked
with a Realised Soul,

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:52.488
with the compassion and love

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:54.178
and proper understanding,

00:16:54.178 --> 00:16:57.298
it amounts to that!

00:16:57.338 --> 00:17:00.848
That you just don’t
enjoy anything in life.

00:17:00.868 --> 00:17:04.775
You analyse everything this way
you are bad, that way you are bad.

00:17:04.775 --> 00:17:06.535
This way you are wrong,
that way you are wrong.

00:17:06.535 --> 00:17:08.945
So, you are wrong completely.
You should be finished,

00:17:08.964 --> 00:17:12.344
you are good for nothing,
useless, thrown away.

00:17:12.354 --> 00:17:17.064
End up in the lunatic asylums,

00:17:17.074 --> 00:17:22.404
or in some another wretched place

00:17:22.413 --> 00:17:26.033
which is not meant for
human habitation at all.

00:17:32.143 --> 00:17:35.575
Idiotic it is, I must say. Stupid!

00:17:40.808 --> 00:17:43.308
It is like a

00:17:43.308 --> 00:17:45.418
we call it in Marathi ‘dhoopatni’

00:17:45.418 --> 00:17:50.888
Dhoopatni is a thing we use for
burning the incense, you see?

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:53.898
It is hollow on this side, and
hollow on the other side also,

00:17:53.898 --> 00:18:00.844
because the one side is the stand, the
other side is where you put the incense.

00:18:00.864 --> 00:18:04.828
So, you take that ‘dhoopatni’ and
you ask for something, you see.

00:18:04.828 --> 00:18:08.316
Something is giving on this cup, you
turn it around for the other side.

00:18:08.343 --> 00:18:11.594
So, the other side face him,

00:18:11.623 --> 00:18:16.536
but this side, that is filled in, is gone, so you
go to see...  you want to see the other side now,

00:18:16.536 --> 00:18:19.036
that what is left in the other
one. There is nothing is left,

00:18:19.036 --> 00:18:21.536
all together. It’s finished

00:18:24.716 --> 00:18:27.216
So it is said that, "Happy Dhoopatni "

00:18:27.216 --> 00:18:31.726
means, the dhoopatni is that thing,
is given to you in the hand.

00:18:31.736 --> 00:18:35.506
So, first you see this side, you
try to feel the joy in the cup.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:42.898
Alright. Then you turn it around
to feel the other side of it.

00:18:42.921 --> 00:18:46.738
But this side you have to receive it,
and the other side is the [unclear].

00:18:56.478 --> 00:18:59.361
So, you need not go to the
right then to the left.

00:18:59.388 --> 00:19:01.701
By the time you go to the
left, the right is over,

00:19:01.701 --> 00:19:06.781
and the right side you run
up too,  the left is over.

00:19:06.811 --> 00:19:09.311
Just be in the centre!

00:19:16.298 --> 00:19:18.798
Push yourself in the centre,

00:19:18.798 --> 00:19:22.022
just be there.

00:19:30.172 --> 00:19:32.672
See the silence!

00:19:34.407 --> 00:19:36.907
The silence of joy crawls in.

00:19:45.965 --> 00:19:49.295
What’s it? What happened?

00:19:52.013 --> 00:19:54.513
Sebastian was sleeping.

00:19:55.923 --> 00:19:57.393
That’s the best!

00:19:57.403 --> 00:19:59.903
He was breathing beautifully.

00:20:02.231 --> 00:20:04.731
Unclear

00:20:14.416 --> 00:20:16.916
That is the best, you
see. To sleep off.

00:20:25.374 --> 00:20:28.270
Now, any questions?

00:20:32.985 --> 00:20:33.944
What’s it?

00:20:33.944 --> 00:20:37.434
How far should we be
concern with other people…

00:20:37.434 --> 00:20:44.284
I mean in certain situations [unclear],
we should have a better understanding

00:20:44.284 --> 00:20:46.784
Ya,  [unclear]

00:21:01.442 --> 00:21:03.942
I would say, you see,  with this,

00:21:03.942 --> 00:21:08.026
that you have wisdom.

00:21:08.036 --> 00:21:11.656
All of you have your, wisdom.

00:21:11.696 --> 00:21:13.706
And you tell them in a way

00:21:13.717 --> 00:21:19.107
that you, "carry the
coal," as they say.

00:21:19.123 --> 00:21:21.623
Because if you tell
somebody – “you are stupid”

00:21:24.063 --> 00:21:28.952
I mean he will make hell for you.

00:21:28.968 --> 00:21:32.572
He better not do that.

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:34.483
Alright.

00:21:34.525 --> 00:21:36.873
Now, if you tell somebody
that, “you are very clever”

00:21:36.873 --> 00:21:40.123
when he is stupid,

00:21:40.133 --> 00:21:42.333
if he is really

00:21:42.333 --> 00:21:44.833
[unclear]

00:21:44.833 --> 00:21:50.933
Yes, they will know that, too. Because
people here are very clever! You see!

00:21:50.966 --> 00:21:53.936
They are stupid in their wisdom,

00:21:53.966 --> 00:21:56.466
but understanding that

00:21:56.466 --> 00:21:59.586
what others are talking and
all that, they know very well!

00:22:01.846 --> 00:22:05.486
So, the best thing is, whenever
you have to work on them,

00:22:05.516 --> 00:22:09.386
work on them secretly.

00:22:09.416 --> 00:22:11.626
Give them a bandhan,

00:22:11.626 --> 00:22:14.126
give them shoe-beating,

00:22:14.126 --> 00:22:17.566
but openly you give them tea.

00:22:18.796 --> 00:22:21.066
Give them some vibrated salt.

00:22:21.066 --> 00:22:26.106
vibrated, of course, of
course, of course, of course.

00:22:26.137 --> 00:22:30.545
Keep Mataji’s photograph
and the candle there,

00:22:30.555 --> 00:22:33.335
and then invite, give them tea,

00:22:33.355 --> 00:22:37.345
give them some chanas.

00:22:37.365 --> 00:22:39.865
You see, that’s how you have
to work with these people,

00:22:39.865 --> 00:22:42.365
because they don’t understand this.

00:22:42.365 --> 00:22:44.865
They may be clever,

00:22:44.865 --> 00:22:47.175
so, give them some chana.

00:22:47.175 --> 00:22:51.863
When they want, to have some
water, give them vibrated water.

00:22:53.873 --> 00:22:56.373
So you work through their stomachs.

00:22:58.643 --> 00:23:03.811
Now, when they start
arguing, avoid arguing

00:23:03.830 --> 00:23:06.330
very wisely.

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:10.510
I think Rustom knows some things,
tricks like that. He does that.

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:13.530
He avoids talking about things.

00:23:13.560 --> 00:23:15.130
I’ve seen him,

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:21.500
and I do it the most of all, I mean,
I’m very good at getting out of things.

00:23:21.544 --> 00:23:24.044
When Gavin does it, is to keep quiet.

00:23:26.311 --> 00:23:28.994
That’s...  there are ways and
methods by which you just

00:23:28.994 --> 00:23:32.364
nail it through.

00:23:32.394 --> 00:23:39.414
Sahaja Yoga methods are very different
from normal methods that you [unclear].

00:23:39.444 --> 00:23:42.734
And these are miraculous methods.

00:23:42.754 --> 00:23:45.014
The best thing if you want
to deal with someone,

00:23:45.014 --> 00:23:47.514
you just leave it to Me,

00:23:47.514 --> 00:23:53.024
and just tell “Mataji
please look after him.”

00:23:53.034 --> 00:23:57.971
And then you will see the results

00:23:57.991 --> 00:24:01.444
how he comes back to the normal.

00:24:01.475 --> 00:24:03.975
You see, many things work out like that,

00:24:03.975 --> 00:24:09.564
as I told you, the other
day we had gone to Crawley,

00:24:09.578 --> 00:24:12.078
and there was a big myth
created, you see, sort of

00:24:12.078 --> 00:24:15.524
a complete opposition
to Mataji was created,

00:24:15.544 --> 00:24:19.074
and one man poor thing fighting
for Me and sort of thing.

00:24:19.074 --> 00:24:21.494
And when we went to the
hall, all of them were

00:24:21.494 --> 00:24:25.524
towards Mataji, absolutely and the
fellow was again put on the pedestal

00:24:25.524 --> 00:24:28.664
and higher of that it was put.

00:24:29.954 --> 00:24:33.029
Because some newspaper people came

00:24:33.074 --> 00:24:35.919
asking for his name, for his
interview, and all that.

00:24:35.919 --> 00:24:37.989
And he was amazed that
how, how they came?

00:24:37.989 --> 00:24:42.035
He doesn’t know why they came to
take there an interview from him?

00:24:44.313 --> 00:24:46.485
So, leave it to miracles,

00:24:46.485 --> 00:24:50.895
as they say, “leave it to Geeves.”

00:24:53.690 --> 00:24:57.635
You see this building reminds me.

00:24:59.370 --> 00:25:03.793
You see, this is "leaving it
to Geeves."  This has worked.

00:25:03.800 --> 00:25:07.483
You see, this building  itself is....

00:25:07.490 --> 00:25:10.730
like these people came
and yesterday you met.

00:25:10.770 --> 00:25:14.510
You must write down all these things
in a diary, I think you people should!

00:25:14.533 --> 00:25:17.963
They went to Weston-super-Mare and

00:25:17.985 --> 00:25:20.293
they all wanted to stay
in Weston-super-Mare,

00:25:20.293 --> 00:25:23.493
and there was no place
for them, no place.

00:25:25.453 --> 00:25:27.953
And they did not know what to do?
And they went all the way from here,

00:25:27.953 --> 00:25:30.453
where to go? What to do?
They wanted to do camping,

00:25:30.453 --> 00:25:33.974
I said, "No, no. Camping is
not allowed for my children."

00:25:33.993 --> 00:25:36.858
So they went down to Bristol,

00:25:36.903 --> 00:25:39.403
to a college to meet a Sahaja yogi,

00:25:39.403 --> 00:25:43.478
and he organised for them, he offered himself,
he said, “Mataji, they can come and stay with us."

00:25:43.478 --> 00:25:49.802
And there was another building just like this,
and they very nicely like lords they lived.

00:25:51.908 --> 00:25:54.702
So, depend on the miracles

00:25:54.708 --> 00:25:56.932
and the angels.

00:25:56.932 --> 00:26:00.462
They are right here. All of
them, attending on to you.

00:26:00.462 --> 00:26:04.452
Just here, all here,

00:26:04.482 --> 00:26:06.142
and you watch for the miracles.

00:26:06.142 --> 00:26:10.332
But we should be surrendered.
If you are not, then no.

00:26:12.831 --> 00:26:15.331
You’ll be amazed how
the miracles work out!

00:26:15.331 --> 00:26:17.831
And those who are closer and closer,

00:26:17.831 --> 00:26:21.549
they would be amazed the
way things are worked out!

00:26:23.758 --> 00:26:25.932
I mean, there are

00:26:25.932 --> 00:26:30.092
so many things that like that. [unclear]

00:26:35.372 --> 00:26:37.872
You should write a diary
of all these things,

00:26:37.872 --> 00:26:41.542
what has happened and how.
Somebody must start it.

00:26:41.562 --> 00:26:45.912
Even this place is nothing but that!

00:26:45.956 --> 00:26:48.222
Yesterday, I just was thinking
where you could be, and

00:26:48.222 --> 00:26:50.422
I hope you are happy [unclear].

00:26:50.442 --> 00:26:52.972
I felt that you are all very happy.

00:26:52.972 --> 00:26:55.942
I was wondering, "They
must have gone somewhere."

00:26:55.942 --> 00:26:58.442
After all, you have to go on the war!

00:26:58.442 --> 00:27:01.813
War front! This is the war here,

00:27:04.222 --> 00:27:06.722
but in a very comfortable way.

00:27:10.842 --> 00:27:13.342
And you are fighting them!

00:27:13.342 --> 00:27:18.512
This place has something
which is to be fought out.

00:27:18.542 --> 00:27:20.472
So, you are sent here.

00:27:20.512 --> 00:27:24.372
Also many to fight.

00:27:24.402 --> 00:27:27.882
A lot of past of England is here,

00:27:27.912 --> 00:27:31.282
which is to be fought, and
that’s how you are here.

00:27:31.302 --> 00:27:34.036
But in comfort.

00:27:35.856 --> 00:27:39.036
You’ll be taken to the right
places where you have to fight,

00:27:39.066 --> 00:27:41.566
but fight in comfort.

00:27:43.236 --> 00:27:45.176
Angels are there,

00:27:45.195 --> 00:27:47.286
and they want to
work through you!

00:27:47.326 --> 00:27:49.296
So they’ll give you all the comfort.

00:27:49.296 --> 00:27:53.656
You see, like a camera that we take
somewhere. You see, we keep it in proper places.

00:27:53.676 --> 00:27:57.016
We may have difficulties in handling
it, and standing somewhere,

00:27:57.042 --> 00:27:58.842
but the camera doesn’t
have any problem.

00:27:58.842 --> 00:28:02.202
We must look after the camera
because it’s a delicate stuff.

00:28:02.202 --> 00:28:04.302
Like that, you are the instruments.

00:28:04.302 --> 00:28:07.692
So they look after you,
you are not tortured,

00:28:07.712 --> 00:28:10.212
you are not troubled. But I mean,
supposing you get some kinks

00:28:10.212 --> 00:28:12.412
in your head, then nobody can help you.

00:28:12.412 --> 00:28:14.912
That’s a different point.
That’s your style

00:28:14.912 --> 00:28:18.122
is to get kinks in the heads.

00:28:18.142 --> 00:28:22.162
But otherwise, it’s
a very comfortable place!

00:28:26.263 --> 00:28:31.278
And you are fighting, and you
don’t know that you are fighting!

00:28:31.283 --> 00:28:33.783
You don’t know what
you are doing here!

00:28:33.813 --> 00:28:38.653
You think, you are just
sitting and enjoying yourself.

00:28:38.663 --> 00:28:40.957
You are doing great
work sitting down here!

00:28:40.957 --> 00:28:45.449
The whole history of
England is fought here.

00:28:53.782 --> 00:28:56.194
Better now?

00:28:56.194 --> 00:29:00.496
And I was so happy that so
many of you agreed to come.

00:29:00.494 --> 00:29:04.354
If I tell you this, don’t be
frightened for next time.

00:29:09.094 --> 00:29:11.294
So, how far you have to go with others

00:29:11.294 --> 00:29:13.794
is your sense of judgement,

00:29:13.794 --> 00:29:16.554
and you learn this tact.

00:29:16.584 --> 00:29:18.024
There are angels around you.

00:29:18.024 --> 00:29:20.524
They will put your hand through it,
they will make you receive it

00:29:20.524 --> 00:29:24.964
tell what, how to do.

00:29:24.984 --> 00:29:28.445
That you should get thirty
people for Sahaja Yoga,

00:29:28.455 --> 00:29:29.925
is something remarkable.

00:29:29.925 --> 00:29:32.785
I had one person to
begin with in India.

00:29:32.825 --> 00:29:36.515
One person! One old
lady of sixty years.

00:29:38.223 --> 00:29:41.635
You are lucky people, I must say.

00:29:41.633 --> 00:29:43.465
Already things are arranged

00:29:43.470 --> 00:29:45.970
because when she told Me that there

00:29:45.970 --> 00:29:52.215
was like a shop, you see, everybody is
telling them about yourself and all that, and

00:29:52.255 --> 00:29:54.755
there is one, some Raja yogis came,

00:29:54.755 --> 00:29:59.857
they never appeared and there were TM
people, of course they are out now.

00:29:59.855 --> 00:30:03.370
It’s so.

00:30:03.395 --> 00:30:05.895
It’s all worked out beforehand.

00:30:10.345 --> 00:30:13.923
I mean, imagine this place to be

00:30:13.945 --> 00:30:17.373
found out by Don.

00:30:23.265 --> 00:30:28.405
Where ever you are, you
are spreading light,

00:30:28.434 --> 00:30:31.385
you do not know about
it, but it is there.

00:30:31.404 --> 00:30:33.904
Only keep your lanterns clean,

00:30:34.964 --> 00:30:40.157
don’t get to kinks and waste
My energy for nothing at all.

00:30:43.675 --> 00:30:47.577
And you will be amazed how
much light you are emitting,

00:30:49.808 --> 00:30:52.767
and how much you are fighting,

00:30:52.798 --> 00:30:55.298
and how many people
you are impressing!

00:30:58.408 --> 00:31:02.863
So, you will be amazed that if
you leave it to Sahaja Yoga,

00:31:02.891 --> 00:31:05.391
after some time you will just give up.

00:31:05.391 --> 00:31:07.891
If you do not like a certain
thing, you just give up,

00:31:07.891 --> 00:31:11.334
and you will not be bothered,
and neither you will be sorry.

00:31:14.927 --> 00:31:18.254
Like I have seen My grandchildren, you
see, they come and work on somebody,

00:31:18.282 --> 00:31:20.912
for a while they'll climb
on, and they will do this,

00:31:20.912 --> 00:31:24.532
and they work very
hard, and it’s cling on,

00:31:24.562 --> 00:31:28.012
but after some time they just get away.

00:31:29.405 --> 00:31:33.196
Absolutely, all of them will leave just
like the dogs, you see, leave the bone.

00:31:33.196 --> 00:31:37.756
In the same way, this bone is left now
nothing more can be done. They get out .

00:31:37.786 --> 00:31:39.696
It happens like that, spontaneously.

00:31:39.696 --> 00:31:42.436
Then you don’t even feel sorry
that you have not done anything,

00:31:42.436 --> 00:31:44.936
"Oh you worked so hard, it
is such a waste" and all that.

00:31:44.936 --> 00:31:47.436
You don’t think all these things.
You say, "Now we've done."

00:31:47.436 --> 00:31:49.936
"Let it be."

00:31:49.936 --> 00:31:54.686
But so many people, whom you will
think you have left, will come back.

00:32:00.736 --> 00:32:02.048
What’s it?

00:32:02.048 --> 00:32:04.548
The tea and coffee is
ready for everyone.

00:32:04.548 --> 00:32:06.618
Alright. [unclear],
we have to go there.

00:32:06.618 --> 00:32:09.468
We can bring it to You. But, I
think, most of us we have to …

00:32:09.498 --> 00:32:11.998
Alright, then go ahead.

00:32:16.368 --> 00:32:18.868
Better offer tea.

00:32:20.585 --> 00:32:23.085
May God bless you!

00:32:25.995 --> 00:32:28.495
for example supposing you say
you are a Buddhist, supposing.

00:32:28.495 --> 00:32:30.995
One says, "I'm a buddhist."
You don't become a Buddha

00:32:30.995 --> 00:32:33.495
by any chance at all.

00:32:35.046 --> 00:32:37.546
And this understanding goes on

00:32:37.546 --> 00:32:41.406
disappearing after sometime,
you see, among human beings.

00:32:41.426 --> 00:32:43.926
And I was amazed that
really the head of the Zen

00:32:43.936 --> 00:32:45.606
is not a realised soul

00:32:45.614 --> 00:32:47.306
and I told him, but he told me

00:32:47.299 --> 00:32:49.799
they had only 26 kashapas so far.

00:32:49.799 --> 00:32:53.749
Only 26 realised souls they had

00:32:53.779 --> 00:32:58.129
And he was travelling with about
500 disciples when he came to India

00:32:58.149 --> 00:33:00.827
and none of them were
realised is a fact.

00:33:00.863 --> 00:33:03.363
You see, now supposing you are an Indian

00:33:03.363 --> 00:33:08.873
and if I tell here to someone that
in India if you go, these temples

00:33:08.913 --> 00:33:10.773
are now being

00:33:10.773 --> 00:33:13.023
a fortress of tantrics

00:33:13.023 --> 00:33:15.303
and people are using the temples

00:33:15.303 --> 00:33:17.803
which have living deities

00:33:17.803 --> 00:33:21.593
there's something wrong with
these, people won't like.

00:33:21.603 --> 00:33:23.613
But it's a fact!

00:33:23.613 --> 00:33:25.733
If you go there, you'll be amazed

00:33:25.753 --> 00:33:29.893
You see I could speak to them about these
things because they had invited Me for this.

00:33:29.893 --> 00:33:32.393
I explained to them what is real

00:33:32.393 --> 00:33:34.583
and I told them what
your temples mean

00:33:34.613 --> 00:33:36.892
and how you go into thoughtless
awareness and all that.

00:33:36.922 --> 00:33:39.422
But, first thing is realisation.

00:33:39.422 --> 00:33:44.642
without that nothing happens, you see,
it is all prescribed for realised souls,

00:33:44.642 --> 00:33:48.132
Zen, Zen means 'dyan' meditation.

00:33:48.156 --> 00:33:49.604
Those who are not meditating,

00:33:49.608 --> 00:33:52.284
means who are not realised
cannot understand Zen at all.

00:33:52.292 --> 00:33:54.036
You are to be meditating.

00:33:54.033 --> 00:33:57.263
Otherwise it is just a joke going
on; it's a drama going on, you see.

00:33:57.263 --> 00:33:59.763
People are just thinking
and by reading Zen

00:33:59.763 --> 00:34:01.922
and all that, you are
going to achieve something.

00:34:01.955 --> 00:34:03.892
You cannot achieve
anything by reading.

00:34:03.923 --> 00:34:06.793
Even if you read Bible or Gita,
you cannot achieve anything.

00:34:06.793 --> 00:34:08.773
It's only reading!

00:34:08.773 --> 00:34:12.413
unclear

00:34:12.413 --> 00:34:16.683
[unclear]

00:34:16.703 --> 00:34:19.203
All of them are real?  Not one!

00:34:19.203 --> 00:34:20.933
You'll find seventy five percent...

00:34:20.933 --> 00:34:22.763
A hundred percent!

00:34:22.763 --> 00:34:27.753
I have travelled all over the world.

00:34:27.763 --> 00:34:29.743
I have been up to Chile,

00:34:29.743 --> 00:34:33.593
up to Argentina, up to Colombia.

00:34:33.603 --> 00:34:35.883
Except for Australia, I've been everywhere,

00:34:35.883 --> 00:34:38.383
but I've met many Australians

00:34:38.383 --> 00:34:41.753
and I can tell you, I haven't met one

00:34:41.783 --> 00:34:47.833
one sect, which has anything of
truth left in them. Not one sect!

00:34:47.843 --> 00:34:49.623
Leave alone the religion part!

00:34:49.623 --> 00:34:52.123
Not even one!

00:34:53.423 --> 00:34:55.923
Like people like, in India
there was a very decent one

00:34:55.923 --> 00:35:00.723
Vallabhacharya was a great man. I mean he
was like an incarnation like that he was.

00:35:00.743 --> 00:35:05.187
His disciples are... I
was amazed that even they were.

00:35:05.217 --> 00:35:08.147
When he had just done the same
things that I am telling you,

00:35:08.147 --> 00:35:09.797
that  you have to get your realisation,

00:35:09.797 --> 00:35:13.527
without realisation....  but they
were also just the same

00:35:13.546 --> 00:35:18.086
they are also following, you
see, something that is dead.

00:35:18.126 --> 00:35:19.856
You see supposing
you are not realised

00:35:19.880 --> 00:35:21.786
and you start doing
Sahaja Yoga to someone

00:35:21.811 --> 00:35:25.106
moving your hands like this and raising
the kundalini. What will you do?

00:35:25.106 --> 00:35:27.606
You cannot do anything.

00:35:27.606 --> 00:35:30.106
So, before,  you see, feeling anything

00:35:30.106 --> 00:35:33.586
about what I say, you get your
vibrations all right first of all.

00:35:33.609 --> 00:35:36.539
You get yourself Realised
that's the main thing

00:35:36.609 --> 00:35:39.649
once your vibrations are all right
then you can judge it better,

00:35:39.649 --> 00:35:41.239
because before that you cannot

00:35:41.244 --> 00:35:47.769
because there is no rapport with
the truth and with the absolute.

00:35:47.799 --> 00:35:51.279
You must get your vibrations corrected.

00:35:51.330 --> 00:35:53.830
First your vibrations must be
corrected, you must be realised

00:35:53.830 --> 00:35:57.810
and then you must judge
it, otherwise you cannot.

00:35:57.830 --> 00:36:01.060
This is why it is, you see, we can spread anything

00:36:01.099 --> 00:36:04.150
which is false, because there I don't
have to put a condition on you,

00:36:04.150 --> 00:36:07.480
here you have to be realised
and you have to be settled down

00:36:07.521 --> 00:36:10.851
then only you'll understand
without that... by paying money,

00:36:10.853 --> 00:36:15.441
say by joining any committees or by
becoming any member of it you cannot.

00:36:15.457 --> 00:36:17.151
You cannot become a  Sahaja Yogi.

00:36:17.151 --> 00:36:20.091
Sahaja Yogi can only become,
if you have got the vibrations,

00:36:20.091 --> 00:36:22.631
if you can raise the kundalini, then only

00:36:22.631 --> 00:36:24.141
you can be a Sahaja Yogi.

00:36:24.173 --> 00:36:26.673
This is a very big condition.

00:36:28.993 --> 00:36:32.151
I mean if you are some sort of a society
as you have Buddha society [unclear]

00:36:32.151 --> 00:36:35.831
you can have, say, a church
or a temple or any society

00:36:35.845 --> 00:36:37.951
anybody can join.

00:36:37.934 --> 00:36:41.184
You can join it, but you
cannot be called that.

