thing, My job is to tell them, this is
a wall, now you don’t hit your head.

00:51:01.364 --> 00:51:06.964
And being a Mother, you can imagine, I
see them as little babies now newly born.

00:51:06.976 --> 00:51:14.744
So I feel concern and I tell them very positively, very clearly that don’t jump into that fire.

00:51:14.758 --> 00:51:16.584
But still they do, some
of them, Sheila did that.

00:51:16.584 --> 00:51:18.434
Absolutely, I said to
Gregoire this morning

00:51:18.434 --> 00:51:20.934
although we know that you
haven't got chilli we think

00:51:20.934 --> 00:51:23.434
I know Mataji told me that that will burn me

00:51:23.434 --> 00:51:26.734
but I'm just going to put one finger
in a little bit to make sure

00:51:26.734 --> 00:51:32.994
and once it's burnt you, you know, like you
never.. I mean it just freaks you out completely..

00:51:32.994 --> 00:51:37.164
She didn’t identify at all, she
just visited them once. Once only!

00:51:37.164 --> 00:51:40.466
I was very ill, physically and everything

00:51:40.494 --> 00:51:44.330
an [unclear}  which was being
run by him, though he  wasn't there.

00:51:44.330 --> 00:51:46.830
I don’t like doing the same thing.

00:51:46.830 --> 00:51:51.414
[unclear]  Muktananda! A good job.

00:51:51.424 --> 00:51:52.320
Just imagine

00:51:52.321 --> 00:51:57.020
[unclear]

00:51:57.039 --> 00:52:00.869
And now you see the people from
Muktananda,  now just see My position is,

00:52:00.869 --> 00:52:03.699
they come from Muktananda
here, so many of them.

00:52:03.699 --> 00:52:06.269
I cleanse them, I clean
them, I put them right.

00:52:06.269 --> 00:52:10.335
I tell them whatever it is, why they are
sorry, what's the problems, how it happens.

00:52:10.335 --> 00:52:14.375
I mean, I have to work really, really
very hard for them, really very hard,

00:52:14.398 --> 00:52:18.465
and then they again go into  some trap.

00:52:21.465 --> 00:52:25.725
So it... I have to point it out very clearly,

00:52:25.745 --> 00:52:29.335
that as long as you are
identified with falsehood

00:52:29.362 --> 00:52:32.615
you will not be  Realised.
You cannot get it.

00:52:32.665 --> 00:52:36.605
You have to give up falsehood,
see for yourself, work it out!

00:52:36.605 --> 00:52:39.826
The best judgement: your vibrations!

00:52:39.845 --> 00:52:42.816
You must get it. Now see this girl

00:52:42.835 --> 00:52:46.026
has been reading certain books and
things and that’s gone  on her head

00:52:46.026 --> 00:52:48.656
and she herself can feel it that
there is a blockage  in her head.

00:52:48.656 --> 00:52:51.296
You can feel it yourself, isn’t it?

00:52:51.301 --> 00:52:54.226
If the sensitivity is all right,

00:52:54.231 --> 00:52:56.066
then you go to the right point.

00:52:56.066 --> 00:53:01.318
But no, you see, your sensitivity is
very much blurred and constricted.

00:53:01.318 --> 00:53:05.066
Still there, come here! Now ask
Me other questions, all right?

00:53:05.066 --> 00:53:07.566
So it is for your own good,

00:53:07.566 --> 00:53:13.565
your own good and I’ll tell you. I am not
telling even one thing that is not auspicious

00:53:13.565 --> 00:53:17.305
and I will not,  whether
people like it or not.

00:53:17.320 --> 00:53:19.820
So sometimes I camouflage,

00:53:19.820 --> 00:53:21.930
because things do not go
straight into their heads.

00:53:21.930 --> 00:53:25.480
As I told, that if somebody is stupid,
you shouldn’t say, “You are stupid.”

00:53:27.009 --> 00:53:28.829
Yes!

00:53:28.829 --> 00:53:31.509
One has to go in a round way.
That’s a Mother’s style.

00:53:31.509 --> 00:53:34.769
But I have to tell you the truth,
I am telling you the truth.

00:53:36.369 --> 00:53:39.481
First thing you should do, is
to establish your vibrations.

00:53:39.489 --> 00:53:41.589
First thing is that,
then you talk about it.

00:53:41.589 --> 00:53:43.659
You should say, "Nothing
doing, first my vibrations.

00:53:43.691 --> 00:53:45.781
There are so many people
who have established here.

00:53:45.781 --> 00:53:48.281
Why have I not yet?,
Why not? I must get it.”

00:53:48.281 --> 00:53:51.724
That’s the thing, should be there.

00:53:51.771 --> 00:53:54.754
If that works out …

00:53:54.784 --> 00:53:57.351
it’s very good. If it doesn’t work out,

00:53:57.351 --> 00:54:06.801
then work it out. That’s the only thing
you have to get it, nothing else.

00:54:06.817 --> 00:54:08.167
Is to understand.

00:54:08.167 --> 00:54:10.667
Now I asked her what books did she read.

00:54:10.667 --> 00:54:12.927
What happened? She told Me, you see.

00:54:12.927 --> 00:54:15.647
So, I can now correct it, I know
where is the problem, you see.

00:54:15.647 --> 00:54:21.603
By telling Me facts, what is the
problem, I can correct it better.

00:54:21.633 --> 00:54:26.381
Like a doctor is to be
told, what is the thing.

00:54:26.413 --> 00:54:32.370
Because most of the things,
here in the West, is mental.

00:54:32.413 --> 00:54:35.947
Our reading, our – you see – past life

00:54:35.977 --> 00:54:38.347
and all these things in the
sub-consciousness has come

00:54:38.347 --> 00:54:42.227
and also our ambitions and
our aspirations and all that.

00:54:42.227 --> 00:54:45.578
All these things work out, [unclear]

00:54:45.578 --> 00:54:49.367
So, we have to clear ourselves, we
have to be absolutely cleared out.

00:54:49.371 --> 00:54:52.157
This is what Buddha wanted,
is enlightenment, what else?

00:54:52.177 --> 00:54:55.107
Did He want you people to form
societies?  Nothing of the kind!

00:54:55.137 --> 00:54:58.607
He wanted only to get enlightenment,

00:54:58.607 --> 00:55:02.437
to be able to read themselves
and not some books, you see.

00:55:02.437 --> 00:55:04.937
Buddha wrote no book.

00:55:04.937 --> 00:55:10.206
Nothing He wrote, and those who write
about Him were not Realised  people either.

00:55:12.006 --> 00:55:13.856
He said that you should
not worship anything,

00:55:13.856 --> 00:55:16.216
because He was so fed
up with the people

00:55:16.216 --> 00:55:18.456
who were worshipping
all kinds of nonsense.

00:55:18.456 --> 00:55:22.726
So He said, ‘don’t  worship’. Now they
are worshipping his tooth, his hair,

00:55:22.726 --> 00:55:28.454
his nails, this, that. Of course,
to Me, I know, it is great.

00:55:28.470 --> 00:55:33.360
Everything has a meaning, but to
these people it has no meaning.

00:55:33.384 --> 00:55:37.714
They cannot feel the vibrations of
that, so what are they worshipping?

00:55:37.726 --> 00:55:43.830
Like in Kashmir I went, and I went to a
place and I just got tremendous vibrations

00:55:43.854 --> 00:55:45.754
and I said, “What’s there here?

00:55:45.764 --> 00:55:48.264
Is there a temple or something?”

00:55:48.264 --> 00:55:52.764
They said no. I said, “This place
seems to be really vibrated.”

00:55:52.764 --> 00:55:55.094
I stopped the car and asked the driver.

00:55:55.094 --> 00:56:01.284
He said, “You know there is a 'ek bal' that
is the one hair of Mohamed is put there."

00:56:01.324 --> 00:56:03.314
” Oh, I said, that’s great!”

00:56:03.314 --> 00:56:05.814
And the driver said,

00:56:05.814 --> 00:56:09.144
“What’s great? This hair has
caused so much problem here.

00:56:09.164 --> 00:56:12.964
People have been fighting over it, there
has been so many murders in this place.”

00:56:12.964 --> 00:56:15.784
Now what the poor hair has
done? You see, just imagine.

00:56:15.784 --> 00:56:20.604
To Me, it has given Joy and
such feeling of oneness there.

00:56:20.625 --> 00:56:23.125
And to others it has given fighting.

00:56:23.125 --> 00:56:27.684
The Muslims have been fighting, because
the hair was lost and this and that.

00:56:27.684 --> 00:56:29.344
Then, when the hair was returned,

00:56:29.400 --> 00:56:32.764
they did not know whether it was
a true hair or some other hair …

00:56:37.758 --> 00:56:39.708
Big controversies about things!

00:56:39.708 --> 00:56:48.978
We went to...  there is one place of
Valmiki-Ashram near Bihar, you see.

00:56:48.978 --> 00:56:52.273
On the other side of Bihar in Nepal

00:56:52.273 --> 00:56:56.563
and I went down there, you see, wading
through a river to see that place.

00:56:56.563 --> 00:56:59.743
Just to feel it, I know it is that.

00:56:59.763 --> 00:57:02.263
So then when I came
back, and see, one of the

00:57:02.263 --> 00:57:05.013
very learned men from
Bihar, he was also there.

00:57:05.013 --> 00:57:08.513
He said, “Mother, what do you think, is
this the place where Sita-ji lived?”

00:57:08.553 --> 00:57:11.053
I said, “Yes, She did. She did.” He said,

00:57:11.053 --> 00:57:14.013
“How do You know?” I said, “I know it,

00:57:14.033 --> 00:57:17.363
for one thing, it’s My own
experience that it was so.

00:57:17.405 --> 00:57:20.023
Apart from that, you can
ask any Sahaja Yogi,

00:57:20.023 --> 00:57:25.323
they can say, that this is the place She lived,
because you feel the vibrations throughout.”

00:57:25.343 --> 00:57:28.953
He said, “Really there are books
and books written against it,

00:57:28.984 --> 00:57:31.484
that this is not the place,
it's on the Indian soil,

00:57:31.484 --> 00:57:37.484
not on the Nepali soil, this, that,
all these things … Just imagine!

00:57:37.525 --> 00:57:40.414
They are  fighting
about the Divine Mother

00:57:40.414 --> 00:57:42.624
whether She was born
in Nepal or here.

00:57:42.624 --> 00:57:47.784
She was a Nepali-Lady, She was
born in Nepal, no doubt about it.

00:57:47.780 --> 00:57:50.280
But Nepal is no good,

00:57:50.280 --> 00:57:52.780
they are no good, neither Indians are.

00:57:52.780 --> 00:57:55.095
All are just the same. Horrible people,

00:57:55.095 --> 00:57:57.820
fighting anything good you
bring in, they start fighting.

00:57:57.820 --> 00:58:00.860
What to do with this human nature?

00:58:02.310 --> 00:58:04.220
Actually, these people did not realise

00:58:04.220 --> 00:58:06.640
none of them knew,  as
I know you people.

00:58:06.640 --> 00:58:09.420
Really I can tell this.
Even Christ did not know

00:58:09.440 --> 00:58:12.850
how human beings are crooked.

00:58:12.870 --> 00:58:15.370
They are too good.

00:58:16.830 --> 00:58:19.330
Humanisation has to be completed I think

00:58:19.330 --> 00:58:23.495
in this life of Mine, and I get horrified!

00:58:23.535 --> 00:58:27.285
Still people think I am
ignoramus, I don’t know much.

00:58:27.885 --> 00:58:32.435
I have to still read lots of
things to understand human beings.

00:58:37.236 --> 00:58:42.427
You see, because of their so-called
intelligence, which cheats them,

00:58:44.997 --> 00:58:47.962
because they think, you
know, they can manage,

00:58:49.440 --> 00:58:51.940
they think they can manage everywhere.

00:58:57.035 --> 00:58:59.420
What they are not
managing is themselves,

00:58:59.420 --> 00:59:02.081
their own joys, their own properties,

00:59:02.131 --> 00:59:04.750
their own wealth – that’s
what they are not managing,

00:59:04.750 --> 00:59:06.841
that’s what they are not feeling,

00:59:06.871 --> 00:59:08.911
that’s what they are missing.

00:59:08.911 --> 00:59:11.411
That is within them, so great,

00:59:12.671 --> 00:59:14.827
bubbling,

00:59:14.827 --> 00:59:17.957
manifesting, anxious to come out,

00:59:18.007 --> 00:59:21.617
that’s all missing.

00:59:21.627 --> 00:59:25.887
Now what are they
managing like fools?

00:59:25.897 --> 00:59:31.167
Is out of show!

00:59:31.177 --> 00:59:33.423
Somebody has to say it
and can convince you.

00:59:33.423 --> 00:59:35.923
I am here to convince;

00:59:35.923 --> 00:59:39.323
I am here to convince you,  about Buddha.

00:59:39.362 --> 00:59:43.867
And do you know Buddha
took His birth again?

00:59:43.877 --> 00:59:50.037
He was Hassan and Hussein, one of them
was Buddha, another was Mahavira.

00:59:52.441 --> 00:59:55.257
See the silence.

00:59:57.117 --> 00:59:58.671
Buddhist won’t accept,

00:59:58.671 --> 01:00:03.341
because they got fright of their life,
the way the Buddhist were on [unclear]

01:00:03.383 --> 01:00:08.151
Mohammed Sahib took
His birth as Nanaka.

01:00:08.183 --> 01:00:10.901
If you read Nanaka’s
life, I mean if you read

01:00:10.901 --> 01:00:13.243
what He has to say, all
the time He is saying,

01:00:13.243 --> 01:00:18.183
“Oh God, how are you fighting among
yourselves, the Hindus and the Muslims,

01:00:18.203 --> 01:00:21.773
or the Muslims and the other people?

01:00:21.790 --> 01:00:24.933
I am just the same!
How are you fighting?”

01:00:24.960 --> 01:00:27.343
You see, when He died, Mohammed Sahib

01:00:27.343 --> 01:00:30.267
and  He saw where the religion
was taken by Muslims,

01:00:30.267 --> 01:00:33.213
He was to be born again.  To tell them!

01:00:33.237 --> 01:00:36.153
But when He was born again,
and He started telling,

01:00:36.197 --> 01:00:39.307
people stoned Him.

01:00:39.327 --> 01:00:41.827
And these Sikhs ask them,

01:00:41.827 --> 01:00:45.317
these fools, you go and ask them,
“What He has done?”

01:00:45.317 --> 01:00:48.747
All His life He was trying
to unite both of them

01:00:48.767 --> 01:00:52.627
because He was so much
surprised at this.

01:00:52.687 --> 01:00:56.329
And imagine  the Sikhs, all their
lives they are fighting the Muslims,

01:00:56.329 --> 01:01:00.999
and the Muslims, the fools,
they are fighting the Sikhs.

01:01:07.379 --> 01:01:10.139
I talked to some Arab ladies.

01:01:10.139 --> 01:01:12.639
They agreed with Me.

01:01:12.639 --> 01:01:15.129
There are  so many
who agree with Me,

01:01:15.129 --> 01:01:18.669
you can see, after all they
are intelligent enough to see.

01:01:18.689 --> 01:01:22.139
But something of it lurks in
us which must be taken out,

01:01:22.139 --> 01:01:25.599
which is falsehood. You must
give up all that is falsehood,

01:01:25.630 --> 01:01:28.130
because falsehood keeps
you away from reality

01:01:28.130 --> 01:01:30.630
which is beauty and joy,

01:01:30.630 --> 01:01:33.130
which is yourself.

01:01:36.780 --> 01:01:39.280
When I talked in
nineteen-seventy first time

01:01:39.280 --> 01:01:41.780
and then I had to lash all of them

01:01:41.780 --> 01:01:44.280
I called it spiritual jugglery.

01:01:44.280 --> 01:01:46.870
"Left and right all of them," I said,

01:01:46.900 --> 01:01:49.020
Then  everybody was so frightened.

01:01:49.020 --> 01:01:51.520
There was one Raja of Mundi,
he came, he said, “Mother

01:01:51.520 --> 01:01:53.861
they will go, come and kill You.” I said,

01:01:53.861 --> 01:01:57.490
“This time I am going to kill them.

01:01:57.531 --> 01:02:01.111
Nobody is going to crucify Me
now. Don’t you worry about Me”

01:02:01.111 --> 01:02:04.161
He said, “We are worried about your
well being. You are saying like this, you see,

01:02:04.161 --> 01:02:06.061
people will feel very
angry with You.”

01:02:06.068 --> 01:02:07.968
I said, “Let them come.

01:02:07.979 --> 01:02:10.898
This time I am going to face it.

01:02:10.919 --> 01:02:14.094
It was all right before I put up a show,

01:02:14.109 --> 01:02:16.274
but now no more.

01:02:16.274 --> 01:02:18.774
Let’s have it out."

01:02:21.884 --> 01:02:25.757
Somebody has to say it.

01:02:27.664 --> 01:02:29.854
It’s  very nice for Me to go about,

01:02:29.854 --> 01:02:32.232
"Oh [unclear] I love you, Oh very good,

01:02:32.292 --> 01:02:35.724
In this society is very good.
That church is very good.

01:02:35.724 --> 01:02:39.762
Pope, you're My love." And all that!

01:02:41.940 --> 01:02:43.500
And get all of them together,

01:02:43.497 --> 01:02:46.330
because I am a Realised
Soul no doubt,

01:02:46.357 --> 01:02:49.457
and I can say that, “Oh I am
this, I have got curative powers,

01:02:49.457 --> 01:02:51.347
I am raising Kundalini”
and this and that,

01:02:51.365 --> 01:02:53.157
and get all of them put together.

01:02:53.157 --> 01:02:57.896
I could have done that way, but
it is not going to work out.

01:03:00.533 --> 01:03:03.243
Of course, if they come to Me,

01:03:03.243 --> 01:03:05.063
I’ll manage,

01:03:05.063 --> 01:03:09.064
because there is a certain
protocol of the truth.

01:03:10.793 --> 01:03:13.678
Christ did not go to these
people and tell them.

01:03:13.678 --> 01:03:17.018
He argued with them and told
them, what was the truth.

01:03:20.228 --> 01:03:21.768
Buddha preached non-violence,

01:03:21.792 --> 01:03:26.408
He thought that by non-violence
methods, these people will accept.

01:03:26.458 --> 01:03:28.958
But He found that by doing that,

01:03:28.958 --> 01:03:33.922
what has happened, all the horrible
rakshasas are sitting there, very nicely.

01:03:33.922 --> 01:03:36.422
Anybody who is a good
person is to be tortured,

01:03:36.422 --> 01:03:37.808
that was the lot.

01:03:37.832 --> 01:03:41.665
Anybody who is a religious
person must be killed.

01:03:41.692 --> 01:03:44.855
Anybody who was a Realised
Soul must be crucified.

01:03:44.875 --> 01:03:47.845
This was the pattern of life.

01:03:47.855 --> 01:03:52.915
So, they came as Hassan and
Hussein, and fought it!

01:03:52.948 --> 01:03:54.925
If the time comes,

01:03:54.944 --> 01:04:00.149
the wrath of God will
come upon these people.

01:04:00.174 --> 01:04:05.039
He has a very tremendous wrath.

01:04:05.072 --> 01:04:07.932
If in one incarnation

01:04:07.932 --> 01:04:13.736
if it has not shown, it
doesn’t mean it does not exist

01:04:13.757 --> 01:04:16.367
It does exist.

01:04:20.327 --> 01:04:22.257
It’s all right for Christ to say, that

01:04:22.257 --> 01:04:26.197
if you put...   if somebody
slaps you on one face,

01:04:26.197 --> 01:04:28.527
put the other around.

01:04:28.527 --> 01:04:32.167
It is just to develop your patience,

01:04:32.197 --> 01:04:36.779
but when you slap on one face

01:04:36.829 --> 01:04:41.179
of a  Realised Soul, one side is cleared

01:04:41.191 --> 01:04:43.691
and when you put the other cheek,

01:04:43.691 --> 01:04:46.191
the second side is also cleared.

01:04:48.281 --> 01:04:52.811
Both the sides are just cleared out,

01:04:52.831 --> 01:04:55.631
that’s why it was said.

01:04:55.651 --> 01:04:58.905
The deeper sense is like that.

01:04:58.925 --> 01:05:06.233
And then the person falls at your
feet, asking for forgiveness.

01:05:09.105 --> 01:05:19.473
Just see, a wasp bit Me here and the
vibrations were  a hundred times more.

01:05:19.498 --> 01:05:21.998
Isn’t it a funny thing?

01:05:29.158 --> 01:05:32.818
It is a very deep  secret of  life,

01:05:32.838 --> 01:05:37.608
but at least you must know that,  unless and
until you  give  up all that is falsehood,

01:05:37.608 --> 01:05:41.350
which keeps you floating
on the surface,

01:05:41.390 --> 01:05:43.310
you cannot go deep down.

01:05:43.310 --> 01:05:46.260
These are all bubbles, you know,
you must have seen people floating

01:05:46.260 --> 01:05:49.850
with two,

01:05:49.859 --> 01:05:52.216
two balloons  jetting out, you see.

01:05:52.216 --> 01:05:54.716
In the same way, our ego and
superego keeps you floating.

01:05:54.716 --> 01:05:58.336
It doesn’t allow you to go
deep down into yourself.

01:05:58.366 --> 01:06:00.866
So by rationality you
cannot understand it.

01:06:00.866 --> 01:06:03.366
You give up your rationality,

01:06:03.366 --> 01:06:06.736
come deep down in the centre.
You have to move there.

01:06:08.556 --> 01:06:14.476
Buddha did His job; He built  up here,
left hand side,  your personality.

01:06:14.506 --> 01:06:17.070
Mahavira did His job here.

01:06:17.120 --> 01:06:24.370
Now it’s  My job to do it, is to break
your Brahmarandra and let Me do it.

01:06:24.400 --> 01:06:27.850
They are all within Me, They
are part and parcel of Me,

01:06:27.850 --> 01:06:32.561
I'm theirs and they are mine;

01:06:32.600 --> 01:06:35.100
every minute, every second,

01:06:35.100 --> 01:06:37.910
every moment they are here.

01:06:39.500 --> 01:06:42.000
Don’t worry about Me.

01:06:42.000 --> 01:06:46.183
Don’t  worry about yourself.

01:06:52.832 --> 01:06:56.451
You just think how far you have
gone with your meditation,

01:06:56.461 --> 01:06:58.531
how deep you have
gone into your Self.

01:06:58.531 --> 01:07:03.081
If you have not gone, it’s
not a mistake of Sahaja Yoga,

01:07:03.123 --> 01:07:05.623
but is your own mistake.

01:07:05.623 --> 01:07:08.692
It is something wrong
somewhere. Just ...

01:07:08.753 --> 01:07:14.182
where is the mistake?  Is your ego  bloating
up  or is your super-ego  bloating up?

01:07:14.192 --> 01:07:17.362
What is not clear with you?

01:07:20.372 --> 01:07:23.607
Dive into your being?

01:07:33.819 --> 01:07:37.730
See now, how much I am
working hard on you

01:07:37.749 --> 01:07:40.249
days in and days out.

01:07:43.477 --> 01:07:47.087
It is a simple thing.

01:07:47.089 --> 01:07:50.967
In India, we had someone

01:07:50.990 --> 01:07:57.570
who belonged to a big organisation, and he
came round, and he started arguing out.

01:07:59.985 --> 01:08:02.985
So,

01:08:02.995 --> 01:08:05.145
one of the Sahaja Yogis asked,

01:08:05.145 --> 01:08:09.150
“Now come and tell me, how many people
you have given realisation to,

01:08:09.150 --> 01:08:12.975
how many people you have cured?”

01:08:12.970 --> 01:08:15.470
He said, "None."

01:08:15.470 --> 01:08:18.588
Then he said, “What are
you talking to Mataji?

01:08:18.610 --> 01:08:22.018
She has given realisation to
thousands, you have seen it.

01:08:22.017 --> 01:08:24.517
She has cured thousands of people,

01:08:24.517 --> 01:08:27.330
we have cured also,

01:08:27.337 --> 01:08:31.460
so better take it
from Her instead of

01:08:31.463 --> 01:08:37.943
getting angry with Her and telling Her
about this big organisation that you have.”

01:08:37.970 --> 01:08:40.130
When the fellow was changed,

01:08:40.130 --> 01:08:44.130
and when he went and told his organisation
people, who were following him as a guru,

01:08:44.130 --> 01:08:46.630
they said, “Oh, he is gone
mad.” They left him,

01:08:46.630 --> 01:08:51.475
and they selected another
mad man to be their guru.

01:08:52.821 --> 01:08:55.321
Nobody is going to stand by you,

01:08:55.321 --> 01:09:00.187
organisation-wise, I can tell you. All
your organisations will never accept Me

01:09:00.187 --> 01:09:02.501
as a guru, never.

01:09:02.501 --> 01:09:05.001
Because they stand
on some falsehood.

01:09:06.541 --> 01:09:09.041
They will never accept
Me, the whole of it.

01:09:09.041 --> 01:09:13.041
None of these organisations
are going to accept Me.

01:09:16.437 --> 01:09:18.937
In America, I have
seen the same thing.

01:09:20.185 --> 01:09:22.685
It is a sad thing, but
it is the same thing.

01:09:22.685 --> 01:09:27.115
There is one lady who is running, she
calls it “Light of the Universe.”

01:09:27.139 --> 01:09:31.029
She invited Me there, and she [unclear]

01:09:31.029 --> 01:09:34.919
She  arranged for Me a three days
conference and all that, you see.

01:09:34.939 --> 01:09:38.182
At the end of it  she took
Me down into her house,

01:09:38.182 --> 01:09:41.639
down  below, and  there
she had made a temple

01:09:41.639 --> 01:09:43.839
and all full of bhoots

01:09:43.839 --> 01:09:46.555
and she said, “Here I call
my master from Tibet.”

01:09:46.555 --> 01:09:49.055
I said, “Very nice, and
why have you called Me?”

01:09:50.975 --> 01:09:54.275
I put a bandhan to her and
all that. I came away.

01:09:54.310 --> 01:09:57.925
So, some people left her
completely, to join Me.

01:09:57.945 --> 01:10:00.445
She was writing to Me
that, I should go to her,

01:10:00.445 --> 01:10:04.736
  and again I have to speak  because
she makes a lot of money out of that.

01:10:04.735 --> 01:10:07.666
But I told her not to
meet for some time.

01:10:12.185 --> 01:10:14.685
So the whole of it
won’t come to Me,

01:10:14.685 --> 01:10:17.185
because the basis is wrong,

01:10:17.185 --> 01:10:20.425
the basis is wrong,
absolute falsehood it is.

01:10:20.446 --> 01:10:23.156
The basis of all these organisations is wrong.

01:10:23.156 --> 01:10:28.170
It has done no good, if you see it very
clearly and honestly, they had done no good.

01:10:28.170 --> 01:10:30.670
At the most they are
philanthropic things,

01:10:30.670 --> 01:10:33.875
like, we can say, a council

01:10:33.910 --> 01:10:37.425
which is rendering help
to some sick people,

01:10:37.455 --> 01:10:40.147
to admit in the hospital, some
this and that, that’s all.

01:10:40.147 --> 01:10:42.647
At the most, if they
have done anything.

01:10:42.647 --> 01:10:45.147
So, you are like councilmen,
you see, council people.

01:10:45.147 --> 01:10:48.342
But why bring in God there?

01:10:53.077 --> 01:10:55.577
It’s all right, you are social
workers, do the social work.

01:10:55.577 --> 01:10:58.077
That  is not spiritual work.

01:11:00.197 --> 01:11:04.666
Spiritual work is spiritual work,

01:11:04.697 --> 01:11:07.197
where you have to be awakened.

01:11:11.447 --> 01:11:13.002
You understand?

01:11:13.005 --> 01:11:17.375
So, all those societies or all
those religions, all of them,

01:11:17.409 --> 01:11:19.565
one and all, hundred percent.

01:11:19.565 --> 01:11:21.015
You are saying twenty-five percent,

01:11:21.015 --> 01:11:24.045
I would say even if one percent
is there, I’ll thank My stars.

01:11:24.045 --> 01:11:26.545
Even one percent, I've not seen

01:11:26.545 --> 01:11:30.395
a genuine one which is based on

01:11:30.425 --> 01:11:33.465
giving  Realisation to people
in the real sense of the word.

01:11:33.465 --> 01:11:36.808
This so called, this  Daya Mata's
 place, I have been there.

01:11:36.808 --> 01:11:38.915
This Yogananda was
not a  Realised Soul,

01:11:38.915 --> 01:11:41.270
you will be shocked that  ‘Babaji
and ‘Dadaji’ and all of them

01:11:41.270 --> 01:11:43.085
were not Realised Souls at all.

01:11:43.085 --> 01:11:45.585
Now the people who were
there have come and told Me.

01:11:45.585 --> 01:11:49.655
You see they, there was a doctor
we had, he died of that.

01:11:49.673 --> 01:11:52.475
He used to do all the  Khechari,
he used to take... cut his tongue,

01:11:52.503 --> 01:11:54.845
put it back, put it here, you see.

01:11:54.845 --> 01:11:56.285
Imagine all these things

01:11:56.285 --> 01:11:58.785
and always his tongue
used to wag  like that,

01:11:58.785 --> 01:12:01.285
and he had to put some sort of a

01:12:01.285 --> 01:12:04.455
hold for his tongue. Otherwise the
tongue would wag out like that.

01:12:04.455 --> 01:12:07.635
He had cut it through his thread

01:12:07.655 --> 01:12:10.155
and turned it up, put it here

01:12:10.155 --> 01:12:13.475
for raising the Kundalini. Just imagine!

01:12:13.505 --> 01:12:15.745
Now if somebody comes like
that, what should I say,

01:12:15.745 --> 01:12:18.705
“Now you cut your nose
and put it inside?”

01:12:19.995 --> 01:12:22.361
Just tell Me!  There
are people like that.

01:12:22.361 --> 01:12:24.785
This  Yogananda’s school,

01:12:24.785 --> 01:12:26.465
they are doing Khechari

01:12:26.505 --> 01:12:28.645
Kabira came, and He lashed them,

01:12:28.645 --> 01:12:30.635
completely this
Khechari and all that.

01:12:30.635 --> 01:12:33.135
He said, “One day your
tongue will be cut,

01:12:33.135 --> 01:12:36.125
your noses will be cut
and this will happen.

01:12:36.125 --> 01:12:38.625
You will be hanging down
head downwards in the hell,

01:12:38.625 --> 01:12:42.604
the way you are treating these
people, those who are seeking.”

01:12:42.634 --> 01:12:45.134
These are the people, and
they publish books, you see.

01:12:45.134 --> 01:12:46.779
Their books will be published

01:12:46.824 --> 01:12:49.324
and all that, they will have BBC-Programs

01:12:49.324 --> 01:12:51.824
and everything will support
them and help them, because

01:12:51.824 --> 01:12:54.813
they are all based on falsehood.

01:12:56.363 --> 01:12:59.793
What did they do to Christ?

01:12:59.833 --> 01:13:03.003
Did any scientist accept Him?

01:13:03.033 --> 01:13:06.613
Did any bureaucrat accept Him?

01:13:06.633 --> 01:13:10.853
What did they do to Buddha?

01:13:10.843 --> 01:13:14.513
When He lived, He
had a very bad time.

01:13:14.543 --> 01:13:18.872
After His death of course everybody
started making money and things like that.

01:13:18.872 --> 01:13:22.073
But what good  have they done?

01:13:23.142 --> 01:13:25.941
Japanese supposed to be the most

01:13:25.972 --> 01:13:28.981
as you say Japanese are Buddhists.

01:13:29.002 --> 01:13:31.011
Cruellest people ever known!

01:13:31.011 --> 01:13:33.511
Cruellest people are Japanese.

01:13:33.511 --> 01:13:36.011
Cruellest of all, you see,
they have such a funny system.

01:13:36.011 --> 01:13:38.511
I went to Japan; I was amazed

01:13:38.511 --> 01:13:43.496
that any good-looking woman
does not marry in Japan.

01:13:43.516 --> 01:13:47.296
This has come out of Buddhism,
just imagine, a system.

01:13:47.325 --> 01:13:49.825
No good-looking
woman would marry,

01:13:49.825 --> 01:13:52.166
neither an educated
woman would marry,

01:13:52.166 --> 01:13:55.537
only dishwashers marry.

01:13:55.586 --> 01:13:57.997
The women who are absolute useless,

01:13:57.997 --> 01:14:02.477
good for nothing, ugly
looking horrid women

01:14:02.517 --> 01:14:05.017
who are maidservants
in other places,

01:14:05.017 --> 01:14:09.980
they marry, and they are the
mothers of the children of Japan.

01:14:09.980 --> 01:14:11.950
The mother,

01:14:11.950 --> 01:14:15.620
even if her husband beats her,
does anything, has to bear,

01:14:15.620 --> 01:14:18.550
he can make keeps in the
house, concubines there,

01:14:18.580 --> 01:14:21.520
he can go and visit the Geishas, she
is not supposed to say anything.

01:14:21.530 --> 01:14:23.950
And that’s why in the
whole world, you know,

01:14:23.950 --> 01:14:26.718
a Japanese wife is the best.

01:14:29.030 --> 01:14:32.010
She is worse than a slave.

01:14:32.050 --> 01:14:36.260
And if you go to Japan, nobody will
invite you to their houses and homes.

01:14:36.260 --> 01:14:40.100
See I went without My husband, so they
didn’t know what to do about Me, you see.

01:14:40.100 --> 01:14:42.130
They couldn’t take
Me to Geisha houses,

01:14:42.137 --> 01:14:44.637
and they couldn’t take Me
to their houses either.

01:14:44.637 --> 01:14:47.530
So, they didn’t know really
what a pickle I was.

01:14:49.887 --> 01:14:53.377
And I read, they didn’t know
what to really make out of Me.

01:14:53.383 --> 01:14:55.883
I told them I would like to
go to Geisha houses also,

01:14:55.883 --> 01:14:57.807
to see there what’s happens.

01:14:57.807 --> 01:15:00.307
And there I found with these Geishas,
when I was talking to them,

01:15:00.307 --> 01:15:02.624
that they are fed up
of this nonsense.

01:15:02.624 --> 01:15:05.464
They said, you see, “We
are beautiful women,

01:15:05.484 --> 01:15:07.614
so we don’t marry,
because we get the money.

01:15:07.614 --> 01:15:10.114
And we are part-time,
also career girls.”

01:15:10.114 --> 01:15:13.794
There were some part, part-time
Geishas and part-time career girls.

01:15:13.794 --> 01:15:15.524
And they all meet in there.

01:15:15.557 --> 01:15:18.057
You see, they are
absolutely openly like that.

01:15:18.057 --> 01:15:23.017
Here they do it also, I mean the
way the women go out for dating.

01:15:23.017 --> 01:15:28.467
Is what? Is Geisha business!

01:15:28.477 --> 01:15:29.408
Dating is what?

01:15:29.408 --> 01:15:32.788
I mean there they call themselves at
least honestly, they are Geishas,

01:15:32.788 --> 01:15:37.628
but here dating with a man, poor man
has to pay for them every evening,

01:15:37.663 --> 01:15:40.163
when it is too much.

01:15:44.083 --> 01:15:46.438
All this is in a very subtle way here.

01:15:46.438 --> 01:15:50.038
So you see, you say there is no
prostitution and there is prostitution.

01:15:50.071 --> 01:15:52.675
I mean, they said, what are
the laws of prostitution.

01:15:52.675 --> 01:15:57.141
You cannot,  sort of advertise it, but
you can have a sauna bath or something.

01:15:57.141 --> 01:16:00.521
I mean, some sort of a thing that they
have made here with their intelligence.

01:16:00.521 --> 01:16:03.021
But in Japan it is clear-cut,
Geisha is a Geisha,

01:16:03.021 --> 01:16:05.681
a housewife is a housewife,
but if you see a housewife,

01:16:05.681 --> 01:16:08.181
her hands,

01:16:08.181 --> 01:16:13.608
there is no softness, really hard
hands, just like the bark of a tree.

01:16:13.650 --> 01:16:15.458
If you see the feet,

01:16:15.458 --> 01:16:19.258
if you see their legs are
bent, their bodies are bent,

01:16:19.245 --> 01:16:22.648
very young women look so older.

01:16:22.685 --> 01:16:24.525
We were invited to a
very rich man’s house.

01:16:24.555 --> 01:16:27.155
There I saw his daughters-in-law
were beautiful, but

01:16:27.155 --> 01:16:32.395
they had to pay a lot of money to those
girls and to their parents to get them there.

01:16:32.395 --> 01:16:36.621
No girl would marry.

01:16:39.755 --> 01:16:43.875
Then the children, when they see
their mother being treated like this,

01:16:43.885 --> 01:16:45.665
what will happen to them?

01:16:45.665 --> 01:16:50.340
You see, after all, there is a mother’s pride
within them, and they can’t bear it anymore.

01:16:50.380 --> 01:16:54.600
So Japanese are the people, outside
they are very  disciplined,

01:16:54.607 --> 01:16:57.107
you see, they are like the way
the mother is disciplined outside.

01:16:57.547 --> 01:16:58.977
They’ll go on bowing you.

01:16:58.987 --> 01:17:01.487
See, if you don’t stop, they’ll bow on.

01:17:01.487 --> 01:17:03.397
If you stop it, then they will stop.

01:17:03.447 --> 01:17:07.007
They will not stop earlier, but if
there is an accident they’ll get down,

01:17:07.007 --> 01:17:09.964
bow to each other.

01:17:09.987 --> 01:17:13.044
But in the crowd,

01:17:13.074 --> 01:17:15.294
if they find a foreigner,

01:17:15.294 --> 01:17:17.794
they will put their heels [unclear.]

01:17:19.264 --> 01:17:21.764
They kill people in
such a butchery way,

01:17:21.764 --> 01:17:24.954
they are butchers, I tell you!

01:17:25.004 --> 01:17:28.034
They are very disciplined, because
one is talking, nobody will talk.

01:17:28.034 --> 01:17:30.844
They are just like machines.

01:17:30.874 --> 01:17:33.684
Hiroshima gave them a shock,

01:17:34.764 --> 01:17:37.074
that really gave them a
shock, and they were jolted.

01:17:37.074 --> 01:17:42.394
The young people now, the young
women are revolting against it,

01:17:42.419 --> 01:17:44.047
they are realising it.

01:17:44.047 --> 01:17:50.827
I don’t know the way sometimes the
young go on to another mad, crazy day.

01:17:50.847 --> 01:17:55.458
But there is an awakening in Japan.

01:17:55.467 --> 01:17:57.737
Now you can’t blame Buddha for this,

01:17:57.737 --> 01:18:00.237
you cannot blame
Bodhidharma for this,

01:18:00.237 --> 01:18:02.737
the Zen-man who did this.

01:18:02.737 --> 01:18:07.252
He was a  Realised
Soul, no doubt about it.

01:18:07.287 --> 01:18:10.296
They do not understand
anything about  Zen,

01:18:10.357 --> 01:18:12.857
they do not.

01:18:16.517 --> 01:18:20.477
They said, “This is all
very difficult for us.”

01:18:22.422 --> 01:18:24.922
They have certain
things like no place

01:18:24.922 --> 01:18:27.422
which I went and saw Myself,
which I really enjoyed.

01:18:27.422 --> 01:18:30.332
They couldn’t understand
why I was enjoying it.

01:18:30.382 --> 01:18:32.422
They couldn’t understand why I
enjoyed their temples very much,

01:18:32.422 --> 01:18:34.922
what it was to convey,
you see.They have Temples

01:18:34.922 --> 01:18:39.406
which create like, you
can say, a Moss-Temple

01:18:39.406 --> 01:18:41.766
is on top of a hill, you see.

01:18:41.766 --> 01:18:44.026
you have to go through a
building, on top of a hill.

01:18:44.026 --> 01:18:47.086
When you come out there is a
little place, like that only,

01:18:47.126 --> 01:18:56.336
[unclear] this one, and there is a little
mount made like a, like a drop, you see?

01:18:56.336 --> 01:18:58.836
And a little drop here, like
a question-mark, you can say,

01:18:58.836 --> 01:19:00.617
or a  drop here.

01:19:00.617 --> 01:19:04.207
And this all  filled with
small plants of moss.

01:19:04.246 --> 01:19:09.936
You can see it through the,
through the, what do you call them

01:19:09.967 --> 01:19:14.993
the  magnifying glass, beautiful different,
different , you see, mosses are there.

01:19:15.025 --> 01:19:17.143
Now, anybody will say, “What’s this?

01:19:17.143 --> 01:19:20.663
All the way to brought us
here, what is all this?

01:19:22.334 --> 01:19:25.338
Is it a Temple? What
sort of a Temple?”

01:19:25.374 --> 01:19:27.338
Now that is a Zen-style,

01:19:27.334 --> 01:19:31.248
that when you see it, you
cannot answer why, how!

01:19:31.251 --> 01:19:34.641
You just stop there in
thoughtless awareness.

01:19:34.671 --> 01:19:37.171
It was to awaken your
thoughtless awareness.

01:19:37.171 --> 01:19:40.041
So the Zen-people said, “Now
You tell me what is this?”

01:19:40.042 --> 01:19:43.062
I said, “Is it what Zen has told you.

01:19:43.112 --> 01:19:46.802
This is what, which, should
not make you talk and think!

01:19:46.841 --> 01:19:49.351
You just say that, ‘You watch this”

01:19:49.341 --> 01:19:52.511
and do not ask any questions,
become one with it.”

01:19:52.521 --> 01:19:55.641
That’s what the
Zen-people tried to do.

01:19:55.661 --> 01:19:58.161
They thought that by doing
this, by telling people that,

01:19:58.161 --> 01:20:00.661
“Watch this without thought,
watch this without thought”,

01:20:00.661 --> 01:20:06.221
it will work out. But they did not know
that these people were not even awakened.

01:20:06.221 --> 01:20:08.721
It’s only possible for
people who are awakened.

01:20:08.721 --> 01:20:11.221
They were of that high,
they did not realise,

01:20:11.221 --> 01:20:16.651
that these people were not even awakened,
how can they do things without thought.

01:20:18.881 --> 01:20:22.201
And all these temples are
useless for these  people.

01:20:22.241 --> 01:20:24.741
There is another place
where there is lot of

01:20:24.741 --> 01:20:26.801
sand  spread out,

01:20:26.801 --> 01:20:29.998
and a beautiful pattern drawn on it

01:20:29.998 --> 01:20:34.491
and there are some stones
of various forms put there

01:20:35.651 --> 01:20:40.146
and you have to go sit
around it and see that.

01:20:40.142 --> 01:20:44.726
Everybody who goes there  they
said, “Mad people these are.”

01:20:44.756 --> 01:20:46.226
They take you to a temple,

01:20:46.260 --> 01:20:48.760
and there  you see all these
and one  American  said,

01:20:48.760 --> 01:20:51.260
[unclear]

01:20:53.760 --> 01:20:56.260
I lost  my feet, and what’s this?

01:20:56.260 --> 01:20:58.760
What is it?” And nobody
can understand,

01:20:58.760 --> 01:21:01.390
the Zen-people, don’t understand,
you see,  This is what it is.

01:21:01.390 --> 01:21:04.880
“Very beautiful, you must see,
this is very beautiful,”

01:21:04.880 --> 01:21:07.380
they are telling in their funny English,

01:21:07.380 --> 01:21:09.880
to these Americans, [unclear,
and they say]  really?

01:21:09.880 --> 01:21:12.830
And they have to walk bare-feet,
you see, all the way down.

01:21:12.830 --> 01:21:16.540
They can’t understand why all
this circus was done for them,

01:21:16.540 --> 01:21:19.210
and the ones who is  explaining
do not know. They do nothing

01:21:19.210 --> 01:21:21.710
but the same thing,
that you watch a thing,

01:21:21.710 --> 01:21:25.526
which does not communicate anything
to you, so you become quiet.

01:21:25.526 --> 01:21:28.026
Then they start comparing
as usual about ideas are,

01:21:28.026 --> 01:21:32.124
that –  “Oh!  This is like an ocean and
in the ocean, there are these boats.”

01:21:32.124 --> 01:21:34.624
“It’s rather not like
a boat, I must say.”

01:21:36.204 --> 01:21:38.704
The another one  with
some other idea,

01:21:38.704 --> 01:21:41.204
that this is this, this is this

01:21:41.204 --> 01:21:44.424
but that is the thing,
you don’t have to do!

01:21:44.464 --> 01:21:48.974
You don’t have to compare it with anything,
you just have to see it, without thought!

01:21:49.017 --> 01:21:53.227
That’s what Zen wanted to do, to watch
a flower without thinking of it,

01:21:53.227 --> 01:21:55.977
just watch it as it is.

01:21:55.997 --> 01:21:58.497
How can you do it unless and
until you are thoughtlessly aware?

01:21:58.497 --> 01:22:02.337
And he didn't...  they did not know that
people are not thoughtlessly aware.

01:22:02.337 --> 01:22:05.227
That’s possible only when  the
Kundalini is above the Agnya.

01:22:05.267 --> 01:22:07.767
They thought minimum that
must be with human beings,

01:22:07.767 --> 01:22:12.136
you see, that they are thoughtlessly,
they can become thoughtlessly aware.

01:22:12.145 --> 01:22:16.366
They did not know that
that is also missing,

01:22:16.375 --> 01:22:19.435
because they were of a
very high-quality people.

01:22:19.455 --> 01:22:21.955
All of them were born Realised,  actually.

01:22:21.955 --> 01:22:26.005
Twenty-six of them in six
centuries! Can you believe it?

01:22:28.306 --> 01:22:29.616
Sixth century it started,

01:22:29.619 --> 01:22:33.156
till the twelfth century there were
twenty-six, after that there was not one Kasha.

01:22:33.896 --> 01:22:36.929
Is a fact, it is written down. I
mean, I’m  not telling you a lie.

01:22:39.116 --> 01:22:41.616
So, who can explain what is what?

01:22:41.616 --> 01:22:47.454
It’s  in every religion, in every book
all this nonsense has  been done.

01:22:47.504 --> 01:22:51.376
Blind explaining something that is light.

01:22:53.514 --> 01:22:55.531
It’s an impossibility!

01:22:55.555 --> 01:22:57.611
I do not blame them for that,

01:22:57.635 --> 01:23:01.401
but I blame them there,  that they think, “Oh, we
are the enlightened.  Oh, we are the Buddha.

01:23:01.401 --> 01:23:05.398
We, we, –  know everything,
we are Christ!”

01:23:05.398 --> 01:23:09.121
Christians think, they are all Christians;
means they are Christ themselves.

01:23:10.668 --> 01:23:14.468
This mis-identification is very wrong.

01:23:14.498 --> 01:23:16.068
Do you understand now?

01:23:16.088 --> 01:23:17.265
This is what it is.

01:23:17.325 --> 01:23:19.755
You said all the Buddhist,
all the Buddhists I know

01:23:19.755 --> 01:23:22.255
never say that
enlightenment comes easy.

01:23:22.255 --> 01:23:24.755
It could take a thousand lives.

01:23:24.787 --> 01:23:28.367
That’s, that’s the best way
of deluding people, you see.

01:23:28.367 --> 01:23:31.387
It takes thousand times,
it’s correct. At what time?

01:23:31.407 --> 01:23:37.187
When they were Zens’, it was
very difficult, but not today.

01:23:37.187 --> 01:23:40.647
It was very difficult at the
time of My grandmother’s time

01:23:40.647 --> 01:23:43.147
to think even that you
will go to the moon.

01:23:43.147 --> 01:23:45.947
And even when people went
there, she would not believe it.

01:23:45.987 --> 01:23:48.617
She said, “No, no – you are just
showing a picture, just befooling me.

01:23:48.617 --> 01:23:50.030
How can anybody go?”

01:23:50.030 --> 01:23:52.530
Even if you showed her anything,
she would not believe.

01:23:52.530 --> 01:23:55.381
She said, “It’s all there,
coming to the earth

01:23:55.420 --> 01:23:58.331
and this is what you are just there,
just befooling you, don’t believe them.

01:23:58.331 --> 01:24:00.831
They must be befooling.”

01:24:02.091 --> 01:24:04.841
Even today, if you tell her,
she is not going to believe you,

01:24:04.841 --> 01:24:06.511
because it was impossible.

01:24:06.511 --> 01:24:08.601
Even when I was a student,

01:24:08.601 --> 01:24:13.101
you see, they used to say so many million years
and billion years it will take to go to the moon.

01:24:14.286 --> 01:24:17.524
It has not taken anything like that.

01:24:17.566 --> 01:24:19.654
So, the growth of life,

01:24:19.654 --> 01:24:23.803
when it comes, in the
beginning one flower appears,

01:24:23.833 --> 01:24:26.333
a second appears after
three, four years,

01:24:26.333 --> 01:24:30.403
then when the tree comes up and
when the blossom-time comes,

01:24:30.437 --> 01:24:31.823
so many flowers come up.

01:24:31.823 --> 01:24:34.043
This is a living thing.

01:24:34.043 --> 01:24:38.019
First one fish became a reptile,

01:24:38.033 --> 01:24:40.533
then after many years

01:24:40.533 --> 01:24:43.033
second one came in,

01:24:43.033 --> 01:24:47.403
but after some time
shoals of them became.

01:24:47.409 --> 01:24:50.919
It’s the evolutionary way.

01:24:54.829 --> 01:24:57.329
What they said, was
correct at that time,

01:24:57.329 --> 01:24:59.829
is not correct today.

01:25:03.059 --> 01:25:08.276
Because they say it, are you going to stop
your  Realisation, even if you are getting it?

01:25:11.226 --> 01:25:13.726
For them, it is impossible, not difficult,

01:25:13.726 --> 01:25:17.024
but it is an impossibility,
they can never get  Realisation.

01:25:19.109 --> 01:25:21.609
So what they say, there is truth in it.

01:25:22.839 --> 01:25:26.940
It’s difficult – these Lamas never!

01:25:26.951 --> 01:25:31.100
None of them, not one of them
is going to get  Realisation.

01:25:31.110 --> 01:25:33.610
Take it from Me. Not one!

01:25:34.770 --> 01:25:38.586
I am not defending now
these organisations at all,

01:25:38.586 --> 01:25:40.066
I agree with you. I'm only.....

01:25:40.089 --> 01:25:44.409
I am just  telling you, I am not addressing
it to you, but in general, you see?

01:25:44.425 --> 01:25:46.179
I am just saying a general statement.

01:25:46.195 --> 01:25:48.695
Part of it is of course
your mind that is speaking.

01:25:48.705 --> 01:25:52.935
[unclear] and also gave Me clarification.

01:25:52.935 --> 01:25:56.315
These Lamas are parasites,
absolute  parasites.

01:25:58.765 --> 01:26:01.265
Living on other people’s money, opium.

01:26:01.265 --> 01:26:04.155
Other people’s money,

01:26:04.175 --> 01:26:08.935
dealing in opium, it’s the best trade.

01:26:08.935 --> 01:26:13.178
All  leading an abnormal life  and
doing all kinds of abnormal things.

01:26:15.784 --> 01:26:19.138
They've never  given any
guidance to the whole world.

01:26:19.157 --> 01:26:23.200
It's all guidance how they could
live without spending any money.

01:26:32.834 --> 01:26:35.334
First of all, it is difficult to give  Realisation,

01:26:35.334 --> 01:26:37.004
you can see that.

01:26:37.032 --> 01:26:40.204
Then, when you give them also,
they again go down in to it.

01:26:40.232 --> 01:26:42.732
Then again bring them out,  again they go,

01:26:42.732 --> 01:26:45.891
again deep down.

01:26:51.812 --> 01:26:54.312
If it is not working out, it is not working out.

01:26:54.312 --> 01:26:57.722
Now as it is, if you say that,
“My left hand is tingling”

01:26:57.722 --> 01:27:01.232
I am not telling you that, you are
saying that, it is happening to you

01:27:01.232 --> 01:27:04.512
it is definitely there. So, there is
something wrong. So, you must cure it,

01:27:04.554 --> 01:27:06.454
it’s a simple thing.

01:27:06.465 --> 01:27:10.211
I am not giving any auto-suggestions
that your right hand is paining,

01:27:10.211 --> 01:27:15.235
or left hand is heavy. It is there, and it is
there and you, yourself, you are telling Me.

01:27:15.255 --> 01:27:17.875
So, what I am trying to do is
to help you out, take it out.

01:27:22.375 --> 01:27:25.332
And it is not so easy also for you.
It’s better?

01:27:26.885 --> 01:27:28.572
Hmm, it’s good.

01:27:28.572 --> 01:27:31.412
This hand is so cold and
this one's really hot.

01:27:31.452 --> 01:27:33.952
Ha, see now, she herself is telling Me.

01:27:33.952 --> 01:27:37.492
This one is so cool and this one is so
hot. Now I am not telling her anything.

01:27:37.492 --> 01:27:41.162
(Shri Mataji is rubbing Her hands.)

01:27:41.202 --> 01:27:44.922
Hmm. Put your hand here down.

01:27:44.922 --> 01:27:47.422
Right hand on this side.

01:27:49.767 --> 01:27:53.877
You see, one hand is cold, one
hand is hot. How do you explain?

01:27:53.895 --> 01:27:56.395
You cannot.

01:28:05.255 --> 01:28:10.667
Mataji, yesterday in the seminar one of the
things we didn’t know much about was the Void,

01:28:10.667 --> 01:28:13.167
because it seemed a very
important part of it,

01:28:13.167 --> 01:28:15.667
the Nabhi and Swadishthana around it,

01:28:15.667 --> 01:28:18.167
yet  we didn’t know that much about this .

01:28:18.167 --> 01:28:21.850
Hmm, hmm. So, what do you want to know?

01:28:21.870 --> 01:28:24.860
Well, I mean  how the
Kundalini passes through it,

01:28:24.860 --> 01:28:32.560
because there  [unclear] this
is a difficult thing to bridge.

01:28:32.560 --> 01:28:33.730
What is it?

01:28:33.760 --> 01:28:36.920
He said, it was the most
difficult thing to bridge .

01:28:38.350 --> 01:28:40.850
For them, it was.

01:28:42.310 --> 01:28:44.810
Now, what we call Void,

01:28:44.810 --> 01:28:50.410
maybe, that’s  because says in the
Zen, Void has a different meaning,

01:28:50.435 --> 01:28:52.935
but in Sahaja Yoga, what
part is called as Void?

01:28:52.935 --> 01:28:55.435
You see, in Sahaja Yoga
we do call it as Void,

01:28:55.435 --> 01:28:59.485
a part of it, but if you want,
you can call it Bhavasagara,

01:28:59.491 --> 01:29:01.991
  or you can call it by

01:29:01.991 --> 01:29:04.491
a  Gap, means there's a Gap,

01:29:06.481 --> 01:29:11.271
This is the stomach of a human
being, it is the visceras,

01:29:13.981 --> 01:29:18.401
and it has got two
important Chakras, you see,

01:29:18.441 --> 01:29:23.247
one is the central one,

01:29:23.257 --> 01:29:27.573
which is called as the Vishnu’s Chakra

01:29:27.573 --> 01:29:32.753
and the another one is
Swadishthana which is circling it.

01:29:32.783 --> 01:29:35.283
The relationship between

01:29:35.283 --> 01:29:38.383
the sustaining power that is within us,

01:29:38.433 --> 01:29:40.933
which is the evolutionary power,

01:29:40.933 --> 01:29:46.443
which gives us this
human form from amoeba,

01:29:46.486 --> 01:29:48.986
which is the evolving power within us,

01:29:48.986 --> 01:29:53.296
placed in our stomach,
on the solar plexus.

01:29:53.346 --> 01:29:57.676
This relationship between this power

01:29:57.706 --> 01:30:03.366
and with the five elements ....
